---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  description="Leverage AI's accessibility commitment and how to report a website access problem."
  canonicalPath="/accessibility"
>
  <section class="section">
    <article class="shell surface stack prose legal-page">
      <p class="eyebrow">Last updated June 30, 2026</p>
      <h1>Accessibility</h1>
      <p>
        Leverage AI wants this website to be usable by as many people as possible. The site is
        designed toward WCAG 2.2 Level AA practices, including readable contrast, keyboard access,
        visible focus, meaningful structure, alternative text, and reduced-motion support.
      </p>

      <h2>Known limitations</h2>
      <p>
        Live third-party website previews on case-study pages are controlled by their respective
        site owners and may not match the accessibility behavior of leverageai.network. Every
        preview is paired with a direct link and descriptive context.
      </p>

      <h2>Report a problem</h2>
      <p>
        If something prevents you from accessing information or completing an action, email
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. Include the page address, the problem you
        encountered, and the assistive technology or browser involved when you are comfortable
        sharing it. We will work to provide the information in another format and address the issue.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
